{"id":"1f31d86414fd328f","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-type-g-characterization.md","title":"Type G, Reflexivity and the Löb Property","display":"thm-type-g-characterization — Type G, Reflexivity and the Löb Property","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-type-g-characterization","aliases":["92-thm-type-g-characterization"],"display":"thm-type-g-characterization — Type G, Reflexivity and the Löb Property","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 129–131，Theorem 6（PDF 146–148，已核对图像）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-type-g-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-type-g-characterization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-type-g-characterization — Type G, Reflexivity and the Löb Property"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 129–131，Theorem 6（PDF 146–148，已核对图像）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys},\\mathrm{LobProperty},\\mathrm{TypeG}\">\\(\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys},\\mathrm{LobProperty},\\mathrm{TypeG}\\)</span> 来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a>，均为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 上的结构性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}type\\text{-}g\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}type\\text{-}g\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明链：ReflexiveSys 推出 LöbProperty，按第 IX 章的固定点/P6 证明仅用 Type4 的运算条件即可。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*=B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\\Rightarrow BX\">\\(X^*=B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\\Rightarrow BX\\)</span>。P2/P3 和命题逻辑给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BX^*\\Rightarrow X^*\">\\(BX^*\\Rightarrow X^*\\)</span> 可证（p. 130 的八步推导）。若有 LöbProperty，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> 可证，所以 TypeG 成立。</p>\n<p>若 TypeG，命题逻辑和 P4 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BX\\Rightarrow B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\">\\(BX\\Rightarrow B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\\)</span>，再与 TypeG 公理合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BX\\leftrightarrow_M B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\">\\(BX\\leftrightarrow_M B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\\)</span> 可证。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=BX\\Rightarrow X\">\\(Y=BX\\Rightarrow X\\)</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\leftrightarrow_M(BY\\Rightarrow X)\">\\(Y\\leftrightarrow_M(BY\\Rightarrow X)\\)</span> 可证。因此 ReflexiveSys 成立。这里每次“可证”均表示相应元素属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>，不要求算术编码或一致性。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 pp. 129–131，Theorem 6（PDF 146–148，已核对图像）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys},\\mathrm{LobProperty},\\mathrm{TypeG}$ 来自[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]，均为同一 $M$ 上的结构性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type4}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys},\\mathrm{LobProperty},\\mathrm{TypeG}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}type\\text{-}g\\text{-}characterization}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ReflexiveSys}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{LobProperty}(M)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"X^*=B(BX\\Rightarrow X)\\Rightarrow BX","display":false},{"tex":"BX^*\\Rightarrow X^*","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"BX\\Rightarrow B(BX\\Rightarrow X)","display":false},{"tex":"BX\\leftrightarrow_M B(BX\\Rightarrow X)","display":false},{"tex":"Y=BX\\Rightarrow X","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\leftrightarrow_M(BY\\Rightarrow X)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1833,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]] → [[92-thm-abstract-type4-second-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]。Normal、Stable、Type 4、Type G 的条件分别列出；单固定点版第二不完备性使用的固定点假设更少。"},{"id":"f83c2c57795366ef","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M),\\mathrm{TypeG}(M),\\mathrm{ConSys}(M),\\mathrm{StableSys}(M)$；Löb 性质依 [[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-329","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-type-g-characterization]]"}],"outgoing":["3c0bfff14ec726c0"]}